  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country research idea LAND-at-scale Rwanda: &#x2018;Understanding the link between tenure security and the investment behaviour by Rwandan landholder, resulting from titling and dispute resolution mechanisms&#x2019;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research aims to understand the nexus between land dispute resolution, tenure security and increased investments in Rwanda. In order to answer this question, the research taps into experiences and results of the LAND-at-scale programme in Rwanda, also referred to as the Land Conflict resolution Project (LCRP), and continue to unpack the concept of &#x2018;investment behaviour&#x2019; in order to make it measurable.</narrative>
  </description>
